#: hakubun/ui/qt/settings.py:102 hakubun/ui/gtk/data/settingswindow.ui:598
msgid ""
"How the tracker decides an episode counts as watched: after the fixed wait "
"above, or once playback reaches a percentage of the episode's actual "
"duration. The latter needs the player to report its length over MPRIS, so it "
"only applies when Tracker type is MPRIS."
msgstr ""
"トラッカーがエピソードを視聴済みと判定する方法: 上記の固定待機時間の後、また"
"はエピソードの実際の長さに対する再生位置の割合に達したときです。後者はプレイ"
"ヤーが MPRIS で長さを報告する必要があるため、トラッカー種別が MPRIS の場合の"
"み適用されます。"

#: hakubun/ui/qt/settings.py:120
msgid ""
"Plex and Kodi normally estimate when an episode is \"watched\" from playback "
"position instead of a fixed timer. Enable this to make the currently "
"selected one (Plex or Kodi) use the fixed \"Wait before updating\" time "
"above instead. Has no effect for other tracker types."
msgstr ""
"Plex と Kodi は通常、固定タイマーではなく再生位置からエピソードが「視聴済み」"
